  "review": {
    "note": "Reviewed all direct build, runtime, optional-development, and Node dependencies for the compatible 0.10.1 gallery-deletion cleanup contract. The h2hdb lower bound intentionally increases to >=0.28.2,<0.29 so deployments cannot install the facet-unsafe cleanup implementation. The real add/publish/delete/empty-catalog/CBZ-removal/historical-cleanup E2E passes with the local fixed core on SQLite; its MariaDB 10.11.11 variant is included but was skipped because H2HDB_TEST_MARIADB was not enabled. Registry candidates and Python 3.14 compatibility are recorded in this receipt; no other dependency-bound change is required. Publish ordering must make h2hdb 0.28.2 available before h2hdb-ingest 0.10.1.",
    "status": "reviewed"
  },
